{"schemaVersion":1,"id":450,"sections":[{"id":"1809001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20575],"start":0,"count":20},{"id":"1809001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20576],"start":20,"count":14}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:1","scriptId":20575,"text":"用了一段日子总算是摸清楚了这特别空勤队的基地构架。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:2","scriptId":20575,"text":"外表看是一栋医疗废墟，不过内部确实经过了一系列修筑和改建。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:3","scriptId":20575,"text":"除了钢舞姬的舞装仓库以外，还备有独立的寝室和指挥室。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:4","scriptId":20575,"text":"指挥室采用的是类似航空局的布置，并且还联通了外部航空指挥塔的系统，可以在指挥室监控外部的情况。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:5","scriptId":20575,"text":"这样做一是便于隐蔽，二是即便航空指挥塔受到攻击，指挥室也不会遭到波及。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:6","scriptId":20575,"text":"“不过这里的设施还真是有点简陋，比起死水来说差了不少。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:7","scriptId":20575,"text":"“伙食不好啊，每天吃压缩饼干和罐头，没办法改善一下吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":916,"speaker":"梅丽雅·马尔斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:8","scriptId":20575,"text":"“是啊是啊，饼干不好吃也就算了，连每天喝的水都要配给供应……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":916,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:9","scriptId":20575,"text":"“为了减少补给次数，一直有补给的话，会增加这个基地的暴露概率。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":916,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:10","scriptId":20575,"text":"“目前这个基地中的守备力量并不足，我们就先忍忍吧，时间应该也不会很长。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":584,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:11","scriptId":20575,"text":"“不过看亚当斯长官也没有修复和扩建这个基地的意思。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:12","scriptId":20575,"text":"“是这样子，暂时还没有必要，可能要等到特别空勤队干出点名堂之后才会考虑把这个基地正式化的样子。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":747,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:13","scriptId":20575,"text":"“诶？那要等到什么时候啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":747,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:14","scriptId":20575,"text":"“这就不知道了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":747,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":580,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:15","scriptId":20575,"text":"“就看长官多努力了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":580,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:16","scriptId":20575,"text":"“跟我有什么关系，我又不是卖给空勤队了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":580,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:17","scriptId":20575,"text":"“哈哈，也是呢～～～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":578,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:18","scriptId":20575,"text":"这时突然响起了空袭警报，接着传令通话器也想了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":578,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:19","scriptId":20575,"text":"亚当斯那近乎咆哮的声音从通话器的另一头传了出来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":578,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-PROLOGUE:20575:20","scriptId":20575,"text":"“敌袭！敌袭！！听到的人速度到指挥室集合！！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:1","scriptId":20576,"text":"空中的战车兽数量很少，推测袭击原因可能只是战车兽发现了在地面的工作部队。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:2","scriptId":20576,"text":"为了应对这种突发情况，在基地的航空钢舞姬一直都保持着可以随时出击的状态。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:3","scriptId":20576,"text":"这回也是如此，发现战车兽后，第一时间派出了航空钢舞姬，并在很短的时间内就完成了击杀。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:5","scriptId":20576,"text":"“确保全部击杀没有遗漏。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":1111,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:6","scriptId":20576,"text":"这是亚当斯的绝对命令，考虑到放跑飞行战车兽的麻烦后果，这一命令也无可厚非。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":1111,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:7","scriptId":20576,"text":"让佐伊她们在地面接应，以防其他可能出现的突发情况，而我和亚当斯则在指挥部做部署。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":1111,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:8","scriptId":20576,"text":"“恩，从这场战斗观察下来的情况看，飞行时战车兽的装甲感觉比陆地上的要薄？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:9","scriptId":20576,"text":"“是的，目前击杀的飞行战车兽大都是昆虫类，经过尸检分析，它们的虫翼轻薄，一般机枪也能击穿。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:10","scriptId":20576,"text":"“当然，在陆地上不需要展开翅膀，所以会给人一种装甲厚的感觉。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:11","scriptId":20576,"text":"“确实……就之前一些交战经验来看，昆虫类的战车兽都不太好处理，甲壳很容易跳弹。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:12","scriptId":20576,"text":"“防空炮类型的钢舞姬之后我考虑也会调派一些过来。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:13","scriptId":20576,"text":"“恩，我的陆地钢舞姬们都已经装备了防空炮，不过感觉还不太够，最好能有一些可以远程操作的防空炮台。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:14","scriptId":20576,"text":"“好的，我会考虑的，不过防空设备很难调度，我尽量想办法吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1809001-EPILOGUE:20576:15","scriptId":20576,"text":"（不会是因为这基地太穷，所以搞不到防空设备吧……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
